# Computer and storage icons: mac, disk, cd, folder.
# Derivation: mac 16 loosely follows kMacSmall (lavender screen in a black frame) and
# folder 16 follows kFolder's tab/lavender layout, both from the user's own M5Tab-Macintosh
# preboot_ui.cpp; everything else here is new.
# Original RetroBoot pixel art, drawn from scratch for rbui in the
# spirit of Mac OS 8/9 Platinum; no Apple bitmaps were copied or traced.
# One character per pixel; letters come from palette.txt, "." is transparent.

# Compact all-in-one Mac; the screen shows a tiny desktop with a window.
